@startuml
actor Editor

participant Editor
participant CreateMapUI
participant CreateMapController
participant UserSession
participant Map
participant MapRepository

== Step 1: UI gathers data ==
Editor -> CreateMapUI : enter map name and size

== Step 2: UI delegates to Controller ==
CreateMapUI -> CreateMapController : createMap(name, width, height)

== Step 3: Controller gets user context ==
CreateMapController -> UserSession : getCurrentUser()
UserSession --> CreateMapController : Editor

== Step 4: Validate inputs ==
CreateMapController -> Map : new(name, width, height)
Map -> Map : validateName()
Map -> Map : validateSize()

== Step 5: Global validation ==
CreateMapController -> MapRepository : isNameUnique(name)
MapRepository --> CreateMapController : true/false

alt if name is not unique or data is invalid
    CreateMapController -> CreateMapUI : showError("Invalid name or size")
else
    == Step 6: Create and save map ==
    CreateMapController -> Editor : createMap(name, width, height)
    Editor -> MapRepository : save(map)

    == Step 7: Success feedback ==
    CreateMapController -> CreateMapUI : showSuccess("Map created!")
end
@enduml